#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
ARM RSU / free-share tax calculator.

This is a Python version of the useful part of the
RSUs-French_Tax_Declaration spreadsheet:

- read a Fidelity "View closed lots.csv" export
- optionally read a Fidelity "View open lots.csv" export for consistency checks
- optionally read user-maintained other broker closed/open lots CSV files
- classify each sold lot by ARM award plan using the award catalog JSON
- convert USD values to EUR using a local Banque de France/Webstat CSV
- compute the same 2074 detail columns used by the spreadsheet
- compute the same simple-case summary boxes for 2042-C/2074

Generic plan classification, Fidelity matching hints, and vesting hints live in
rsu_award_catalog.json.
"""

